on exitFrame
  [  0] pushint8 19 ............................. <19>
  [  3] pusharglist 1 ........................... <19>
  [  5] extcall 58 .............................. <sprite(19)>
  [  8] getobjprop 89 ........................... <sprite(19).visible>
  [ 11] pushint8 1 .............................. <1>
  [ 14] eq ...................................... <sprite(19).visible = 1>
  [ 15] jmpifz [ 30] ............................ if sprite(19).visible = 1 then
  [ 18] pushint8 14 ............................. <14>
  [ 21] pusharglist 1 ........................... <14>
  [ 23] extcall 58 .............................. <sprite(14)>
  [ 26] pushzero ................................ <0>
  [ 27] setobjprop 89 ........................... sprite(14).visible = 0
  [ 30] pusharglistnoret 0 ...................... <>
  [ 32] extcall 1 ............................... whatodoeveryframe()
  [ 34] ret
end
